{"t":"128940.KS","n":"Hanmi Pharm. Co., Ltd.","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":457000.0,"chg":21000.0,"chgPct":0.04817,"prev":436000.0,"dayH":463500.0,"dayL":434500.0,"w52H":647000.0,"w52L":302000.0,"vol":64609,"avgVol":129257,"mcap":5804032786432,"pe":null,"fpe":29.06,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":2000.0,"divY":0.0046,"beta":0.6,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Healthcare","sKo":"헬스케어","i":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","iKo":"의약품 제조업체 - 전문의약품 및 일반의약품","city":"Hwaseong-si","emp":2498,"web":"https://www.hanmipharm.com","sum":"Hanmi Pharm. Co., Ltd., a biopharmaceutical company, engages in the manufacture and sale of pharmaceutical products in South Korea, China, Japan, the United States, and internationally. It focuses on research areas with high unmet medical needs, including obesity, metabolism, oncology, and rare diseases. The company's products include Gugutams, a urological combination therapy combining two active ingredients: tamsulosin, a treatment for Obstructive Prostatic Growth (OPG), and tadalafil, a treatment for erectile dysfunction (ED). The company has a research collaboration with MEDIC Life Sciences Inc. to identify cancer biomarkers. The company was founded in 1973 and is based in Hwaseong-si, South Korea.","sumKo":"한미약품. Co., Ltd.는 한국, 중국, 일본, 미국 및 해외에서 의약품을 제조 및 판매하는 바이오 제약 회사입니다. 비만, 신진대사, 종양학, 희귀질환 등 미충족 의료 수요가 높은 연구 분야에 중점을 두고 있습니다. 이 회사의 제품에는 폐쇄성 전립선 성장(OPG) 치료제인 탐스로신(tamsulosin)과 발기부전(ED) 치료제인 타다라필(tadalafil)의 두 가지 유효성분을 결합한 비뇨기과 복합치료제 구구탐스(Gugutams)가 있다. 이 회사는 암 바이오마커를 식별하기 위해 MEDIC Life Sciences Inc.와 연구 협력을 맺고 있습니다. 이 회사는 1973년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 화성에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":982048870000,"ni":76926000000},{"y":2023,"rev":1490887460000,"ni":159284710000},{"y":2024,"rev":1495501580000,"ni":124273000000},{"y":2025,"rev":1547531000000,"ni":170479000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":306073930000,"ni":49040000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":392926000000,"ni